Hi Everyone

Sorry if this is a stupid question, I am sure I have made a number of errors, however this is my first attempt at using secr. I am trying to use mark-resight in secr to estimate elephant density in a national park ~700km2, however, I am returning with unrealistically low estimates when running secr.fit on my data and would appreciate your help as to where I am going wrong.

Data;

-  13 camera traps (minimum 5km apart)

-  Resight only data for 50 sampling occasions

- Used natural markings (tusks/ears) to mark 13 individuals (pre-marked population)

- Capture history of marked individuals with a total of 29 recaptures

- Count data of unmarked individuals (Tu) – 275 elephants

