Hi
I don't think so. You could test this with something like secr.fit(..., details=list(ignoreusage = TRUE)) or by changing usage. g0 is often small. Are you allowing for the fact that g0 is for one animal and one trap? Maybe divide your 0.17 by the number of traps?
Of course I may be wrong.. I'm in a hurry.
